  "description": "Signora is a graceful and elegant signature script font designed to bring a sense of luxury, beauty, and sophistication to your designs. With its smooth flowing strokes and stylish curves, Signora captures the natural charm of modern handwriting while maintaining a refined, high-end aesthetic. Perfect for branding, wedding invitations, logos, packaging, social media, and feminine design projects, Signora adds a personal and classy touch to any creative work. Whether you’re designing elegant stationery, beauty product branding, or stylish quotes, this font effortlessly elevates your visuals with a timeless handwritten feel.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Signora is a graceful and elegant signature script font designed to bring a sense of luxury, beauty, and sophistication to your designs. With its smooth flowing strokes and stylish curves, Signora captures the natural charm of modern handwriting while maintaining a refined, high-end aesthetic. Perfect for branding, wedding invitations, logos, packaging, social media, and feminine design projects, Signora adds a personal and classy touch to any creative work. Whether you’re designing elegant stationery, beauty product branding, or stylish quotes, this font effortlessly elevates your visuals with a timeless handwritten feel.</p>",
